# Debug Log

## Known Issues
- masjidName undefined → caused by unsafe Blade injection
- generateInvoice undefined → caused by script loading/scope

## Fix Patterns
- Always use @json()
- Always attach functions to window

## Lessons
- Inline JS is fragile
- Blade + JS boundary must be handled carefully

## JS Execution Findings
- generateInvoice undefined can occur when only public/js defines it but the page loads resources/js via Vite
- Fix by defining onclick handlers in the active bundled script and adding a temporary window fallback before Vite loads
